description:
Mr. Y R Kori is a practicing Advocate specialising in Tax laws since 1980, our firm is into providing the following services:

•Advisory with respect to taxation;
•Return filing;
•Addressing TDS issues;
•Attending scrutiny matters;
•Attending matters upto First appellate;
•Briefing and coordinating with counsels for higher litigation matters.
Our team consists of 4 CAs for audit related work and 3 Advocates with 20 support staff. Our office is located at Kamala mills, Lower Parel.
